<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between something awarded and the agent making the award, for example linking a grant to a funding agency, a degree to a university, or a prize to the awarding organization."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-grant \n        frapo:isAwardedBy :my-funding-agency .\n    \n    :my-funding-agency a frapo:FundingAgency .\n    " .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isAwardedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is awarded by"@en .
